{
  "id": "ROM.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Romans 2",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore thou art without excuse, O man, whosoever thou art that judgest: for wherein thou judgest another, thou condemnest thyself; for thou that judgest dost practise the same things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And we know that the judgment of God is according to truth against them that practise such things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And reckonest thou this, O man, who judgest them that practise such things, and doest the same, that thou shalt escape the judgment of God? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or despisest thou the riches of his goodness and forbearance and longsuffering, not knowing that the goodness of God leadeth thee to repentance? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but after thy hardness and impenitent heart treasurest up for thyself wrath in the day of wrath and revelation of the righteous judgment of God; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who will render to every man according to his works: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to them that by patience in well-doing seek for glory and honor and incorruption, eternal life: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but unto them that are factious, and obey not the truth, but obey unrighteousness, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wrath and indignation, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tribulation and anguish, upon every soul of man that worketh evil, of the Jew first, and also of the Greek; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but glory and honor and peace to every man that worketh good, to the Jew first, and also to the Greek: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for there is no respect of persons with God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as many as have sinned without the law shall also perish without the law: and as many as have sinned under the law shall be judged by the law; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for not the hearers of the law are just before God, but the doers of the law shall be justified; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(for when Gentiles that have not the law do by nature the things of the law, these, not having the law, are the law unto themselves; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in that they show the work of the law written in their hearts, their conscience bearing witness therewith, and their thoughts one with another accusing or else excusing ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the day when God shall judge the secrets of men, according to my gospel, by Jesus Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if thou bearest the name of a Jew, and restest upon the law, and gloriest in God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and knowest his will, and approvest the things that are excellent, being instructed out of the law, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and art confident that thou thyself art a guide of the blind, a light of them that are in darkness, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a corrector of the foolish, a teacher of babes, having in the law the form of knowledge and of the truth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou therefore that teachest another, teachest thou not thyself? thou that preachest a man should not steal, dost thou steal? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou that sayest a man should not commit adultery, dost thou commit adultery? thou that abhorrest idols, dost thou rob temples? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou who gloriest in the law, through thy transgression of the law dishonorest thou God? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the name of God is blasphemed among the Gentiles because of you, even as it is written. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For circumcision indeed profiteth, if thou be a doer of the law: but if thou be a transgressor of the law, thy circumcision is become uncircumcision. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If therefore the uncircumcision keep the ordinances of the law, shall not his uncircumcision be reckoned for circumcision? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and shall not the uncircumcision which is by nature, if it fulfil the law, judge thee, who with the letter and circumcision art a transgressor of the law? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he is not a Jew who is one outwardly; neither is that circumcision which is outward in the flesh: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but he is a Jew who is one inwardly; and circumcision is that of the heart, in the spirit not in the letter; whose praise is not of men, but of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ROM.3",
    "number": "3",
    "bookId": "ROM"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ROM.1",
    "number": "1",
